1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:06,967
The lights fall to a dim red glow.
Escalators stopped halfway. A
fountain, still. A hundred mannequins,
watching.

2
00:00:07,467 --> 00:00:10,467
Rule one. Know every exit before you
need one.

3
00:00:10,967 --> 00:00:18,100
You walk the whole ground floor. Front
doors, shut. Loading dock, shut. A
fire door with an alarm. You count
them out loud.

4
00:00:18,633 --> 00:00:22,333
Rule two. Sleep in a room with one
door and a back way out.
